    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Very Rare</em></p><p>The letters of the Common alphabet are printed on one side of this ornate wooden board, along with the words “Yes” and “No” and symbols standing for “Weal” and “Woe.” The board comes with a heart-shaped wooden planchette, which must rest on the lettered side for the board’s magic to work.</p><p>The board has 3 charges and regains 1 expended charge daily at dawn. While touching the planchette, you can take 1 minute to cast one of the spells on the following table, expending the number of charges it shows. As you cast the spell, you call on the spirits of the dead to guide the planchette across the board, answering your questions by pointing to letters or words.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Spell</th><th>Charge Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAugury0000]{Augury}</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCommune000]{Commune}</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>",
